            "review_title": "Review at Phở Nhất Vị",
            "review_text": "Dreamer51068591657\n5 contributions\n0\nIncredible Pho with Premium Beef! Best late-night food in Saigon!\nApr 2026 • Couples\nI stumbled upon Pho Nhat Vi during my first night in District 1, and it completely changed my definition of a good bowl of Pho! I ordered the Premium Gau Pho (Beef Brisket) and my partner tried the Australian Beef Rib Pho. The rib was huge, tender, and literally melt-in-your-mouth. The broth was crystal clear, perfectly balanced, and rich in natural flavor (no MSG headache at all!). The place is air-conditioned, super clean, and open 24/7, which is perfect for tourists. Highly recommend checking this place out if you are in Ho Chi Minh City!\nRead more\nWritten May 25, 2026",
